        {
            id: "oxy_fuel",
            title: "Oxy-Fuel",
            icon: "arcforge:firebox",
            description: [
                "Feed Oxygen (from an Electrolyzer or Air Separator) into a Firebox, Fuel Burner or Firebox Array through an Oxygen face: +300°C, 1.25× heat per fuel, 3.125 mB of oxygen per 100 HU. The flame turns blue-white."
