            id: "heat_pipe",
            title: "Heat Pipe",
            icon: "arcforge:heat_pipe",
            description: [
                "The Arcforged answer to long heat runs: a straight pipe up to 32 blocks of Rock Wool, Arcforged Alloy, tungsten plates and an Arcforged Thermodynamic Conduit, 262,144 HU/t with 0.5% loss per block. It only connects at its two ends.",
